{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mercy, no help, no safety in the comfort of save/load systems!<br><i>Izurana's Walk</i> drags you into an adventure you must finish in one sitting!<br>Trapped corridors, puzzles, and boss fights await you on this journey.<br>Will you accompany Izurana on this perilous path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Izurana's Walk</i> offers a 2D adventure with a mix of retro and modern graphics, driven by patience and exploration.<br>In this experience, some levels will test your speed, others your precision\u2014and there will be no one to guide or help you.<br>No save/load system. No tutorial. No hints.<br>It\u2019s just you and the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Izurana's Walk</i> is waiting for you\u2014if you dare to face it!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867510?t=1753859853","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867510/3cf7be95d0f77d9c848d3abd26790aa87d4b8098/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753859853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867510/09010a387bc69d2aceeae3650377b16afcaaf69d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753859853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867510/09010a387bc69d2aceeae3650377b16afcaaf69d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753859853","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mercy, no help, no safety in the comfort of save/load systems!<br><i>Izurana's Walk</i> drags you into an adventure you must finish in one sitting!<br>Trapped corridors, puzzles, and boss fights await you on this journey.<br>Will you accompany Izurana on this perilous path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Izurana's Walk</i> offers a 2D adventure with a mix of retro and modern graphics, driven by pati